1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,006
This is the Dermalogica Daily Microfoliant.

2
00:00:03,006 --> 00:00:07,761
In the next few minutes, we will go through what it does, what is inside, and

3
00:00:07,761 --> 00:00:09,120
exactly how to use it.

4
00:00:09,882 --> 00:00:15,145
It is an exfoliating powder, made to help you achieve brighter, smoother skin every

5
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:15,399
day.

6
00:00:15,399 --> 00:00:20,598
It removes dulling surface debris and evens skin tone, and it is gentle enough for

7
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:21,232
daily use.

8
00:00:22,059 --> 00:00:23,175
The idea is simple.

9
00:00:23,175 --> 00:00:27,993
It removes the dulling debris that sits on the surface, so skin looks brighter and

10
00:00:27,993 --> 00:00:32,458
feels smoother, and because it is gentle, you can make it part of your daily

11
00:00:32,458 --> 00:00:32,928
routine.

12
00:00:33,746 --> 00:00:38,856
The rice-based powder is rich in alpha hydroxy acids, and it activates on contact

13
00:00:38,856 --> 00:00:39,550
with water.

14
00:00:40,313 --> 00:00:45,664
When it does, it releases papain, salicylic acid and rice bran, to polish skin to

15
00:00:45,664 --> 00:00:46,391
perfection.

16
00:00:47,157 --> 00:00:52,638
There is also a Skin Brightening Complex, made of phytic acid from rice bran, white

17
00:00:52,638 --> 00:00:53,827
