18
00:00:53,827 --> 00:00:56,072
It helps balance uneven skin tone.

19
00:00:56,838 --> 00:01:01,169
And a soothing blend of colloidal oatmeal and allantoin helps calm the skin.

20
00:01:01,869 --> 00:01:07,392
So in one step, you get enzymes and acids that polish, a complex that targets uneven

21
00:01:07,392 --> 00:01:11,403
tone, and ingredients that calm the skin while it exfoliates.

22
00:01:12,169 --> 00:01:14,604
It is recommended for all skin types.

23
00:01:14,604 --> 00:01:19,870
It is commonly used for dullness, uneven texture and uneven skin tone, and it is

24
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:22,898
also recommended for blemishes and blackheads.

25
00:01:23,664 --> 00:01:25,001
Here is how to use it.

26
00:01:25,001 --> 00:01:28,101
Dispense about half a teaspoon into very wet hands.

27
00:01:28,801 --> 00:01:31,468
Rub your hands together to create a creamy paste.

28
00:01:32,168 --> 00:01:36,257
Apply it to your face in circular motions, avoiding the eye area.

29
00:01:36,257 --> 00:01:39,592
Massage gently for one minute, then rinse thoroughly.

30
00:01:40,292 --> 00:01:42,287
There is also a foaming technique.

31
00:01:42,287 --> 00:01:45,807
Pour half a teaspoon of powder into your hand and add water.

32
00:01:45,807 --> 00:01:50,735
Rub your hands together until it turns foamy, then massage it onto your face for one

33
00:01:50,735 --> 00:01:53,844
minute in circular motions, and rinse off with water.

34
00:01:54,603 --> 00:01:59,595
Follow with a toner, like Multi-Active Toner or UltraCalming Mist, and your

35
00:01:59,595 --> 00:02:01,192
Dermalogica moisturizer.

36
00:02:01,959 --> 00:02:05,498
If you experience irritation, adjust how often you use it.

37
00:02:05,498 --> 00:02:08,793
And for the full ingredient list, check the packaging.

38
00:02:08,793 --> 00:02:10,684
The link is in the description.
